    </ul>
    <p>For Piscataquis County residents and the Moosehead Lake tourism region, Dover-Foxcroft is the primary cannabis access point. The next-closest dispensary clusters are in Bangor (45 min south) and the Skowhegan / Madison area to the west.</p>
